      "why": "plain and quoted side by side in a sequence"
    },
    {
      "id": "anchor-and-alias",
      "yaml": "a: &x no\nb: *x\n",
      "why": "serde_norway expands the alias; the style pass has to as well"
    },
    {
      "id": "nested-relay",
